/* h_8D11_down (SOUTH): $2F=$31=0, probes $62-$70 and $62+$70 horizontally,
   vertical = $64 + $30; clear -> 9C5C; corner -> set $2E=+/-$10 slide.            */
/* h_8BF9_up (NORTH): $31=$FF, $2F=0, vertical = $64-$70+$30, symmetric to SOUTH.  */
/* h_8E21_upright (NE): corner box, falls back 8EBE->8BF9(up)/8EE8->8AB5(right).   */
/* h_8EF1_upleft (NW): corner box, falls back 8F8D->8BF9(up)/8FB8->8BC4(left).     */
/* h_8FC1_dnleft (SW): corner box, falls back 908A->8D11(down)/9093->8BC4(left).   */
/* h_909C_dnright(SE): corner box, falls back 9163->8D11(down)/916C->8AB5(right).  */

